# Design-gate canary working copies — never committed (plan workspace spec).
# A gate folder can sit in a plan folder or beside any audited document, so the
# pattern is path-agnostic; the gate also deletes the folder once it is used.
**/.canary/

# Mascot explorations that were not chosen. The shipped art is the "tall"
# variant — assets/TALL-PROMPTS.md and the two toque-tall-*.png files are
# tracked and referenced by the documentation. These alternates are ~7.4 MB of
# unreferenced PNGs kept on disk for reuse, not for distribution. Delete a line
# here if one of them is ever adopted.
assets/PROMPTS.md
assets/HAT-PROMPTS.md
assets/chef.png
assets/toque-banner.png
assets/toque-design-gate.png
assets/toque-hat-banner.png
assets/toque-hat-design-gate.png
assets/toque-hat-mascot.png
assets/toque-mascot.png
assets/toque-tall-banner.png
